<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00795">
	<title>Replacing the front wiper blade</title>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e05091">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e05092">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" placement="break" height="1.575in" width="2.244in" href="../../images/OOV075002.eps" id="e05093"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<section>
			<title>Operation</title>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>Turn off the vehicle.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Move the wiper switch to the single wiping (MIST/1x) position within 20 seconds.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Hold the wiper switch for more than 2 seconds.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Raise the wiper arm.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Lift the wiper blade clip up. Pull down the blade assembly and remove it.</p>
					<table frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e05094">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
							<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
							<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="0">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e05095">
											<figgroup>
												<image align="center" placement="break" height="1.575in" width="2.244in" href="../../images/OOV075003.eps" id="e05096"/>
											</figgroup>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2">
										<fig id="e05097">
											<figgroup>
												<image align="center" placement="break" height="1.575in" width="2.244in" href="../../images/OOV075004.eps" id="e05098"/>
											</figgroup>
										</fig>
									</entry>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Install the new blade assembly.</p>
					<table frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="e05099">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
							<colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
							<colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="0">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e05100">
											<figgroup>
												<image align="center" placement="break" height="1.575in" width="2.244in" href="../../images/OOV075005.eps" id="e05101"/>
											</figgroup>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Upon starting the vehicle, the wiper arms will return to their normal operating position.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>